      + '<p class="lede">' + esc(T("The teams and their keys stay, with the signing key and its backup copies, so this Studio keeps leading its teams. The licence stays too, and so does everything in the catalogs' folders on disk.")) + "</p>"
      + '<p class="lede warn">' + esc(T("There is no Undo.")) + "</p>"
